  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 810.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 810.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this part is to identify landfills which are permit-exempt, pursuant to Env-Sw 302.03.\n\nSource. #6619-B, eff 10-29-97; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Sw 800); ss by #8459, eff 10-28-05 (formerly Env-Wm 2510.01); ss by #10597, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14156, eff 12-21-24",
